The sample datasets are not the work of this package's authors. Each is listed below with where
it was taken from, what to cite and its license as far as it is known. The bundled datasets
(datasets/<name>) were converted by scripts/convert-datasets.mjs and the hosted ones (hosted:
<name>, published at https://graphty.app/data/graph-samples/v1/<name>.gsnp.gz) by
scripts/build-hosted.mjs; both record the exact source files and their SHA-256. The converted
data are changed files, not the originals (node order, encoding, merged or dropped repeated
links, and the corrections listed). To have a dataset removed, open an issue at
https://github.com/graphty-org/graphty-monorepo/issues; removing one means deleting its
src/datasets/<name>/ directory (or its entry in scripts/build-hosted.mjs) and its entries in
src/datasets/catalog.ts and this file.

